AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000007> "The phase of the life cycle characterized by the biological process in which certain cells of a female or male individual (parent) are transformed into specialized reproductive cells (gametes) that will initiate development of a progeny individual (offspring) upon fertilization.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000007> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_46514>)
