# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000009> (larval development phase)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000009> "The phase of the life cycle that begins when the mouth opens and the larva starts to feed, continues through the growth and maturation of the larva, and ends with metamorphosis.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000009> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_46514>)
