# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000010> (adulthood phase)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000010> "The phase of the life cycle that begins after metamorphosis, continues through the growth and maturation of the juvenile, and culminates in the formation of a sexually mature adult that produces functional gametes.")
