AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000012> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_7656>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000012> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_7668>)
