# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000014> (organogenesis period)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000014> "The period that immediately follows the gastrula period. It is characterized by the progressive maturation of tissues and organs. This period culminates in the opening of the mouth.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000014> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_46514>)
