# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000015> (mesenchyme blastula episode)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000015> "The first episode of the gastrulation period, characterized by the ingression into the blastocoel of the skeletogenic primary mesenchyme cells (PMCs), prior to the invagination of the vegetal plate.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002161> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000015> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_46514>)
