# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000016> (invagination episode)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000016> "The second episode of the gastrulation period, characterized by the invagination of the vegetal plate into the blastocoel to form the primitive digestive tract (archenteron).")
