# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000036> (early gastrula stage)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000036> "Stage at which the archenteron (primitive digestive tract) has elongated up to 1/3 of its final length. This elongation has occurred through the inward movement of all non-skeletogenic mesoderm (NSM) cells and part of the endoderm.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_1000036> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_46514>)
