AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000106> "An accumulation of pigment granules defining a band (the so-called ‘pigment band’) located in the vegetal hemisphere of mature oocytes or early stage embryos just beneath the equator. When present, it constitutes an unambiguous marker of animal-vegetal polarity.")
