# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000107> (fertilization envelope)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000107> "A structure that lies outside the plasma membrane and surrounds the fertilized eggs and early embryos. The fertilization envelope forms from the vitelline membrane after fertilization as a result of cortical granule release. It persists until hatching.")
