AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000114> "A fibrous, extracellular network that forms the inner part of the hyaline layer. The apical lamina persists after the biochemical removal of hyalin and is thought to be principally composed of the glycoproteins fibropellins.")
