AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000116> "A cytoplasmic, membrane bound vesicle that is capable of fusing to the plasma membrane and to release its contents into the extracellular space.")
