# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000119> (short motile cilium)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000119> "A cilium of short size exhibiting motility thanks to the molecular motors it contains. In echinoderms, short motile cilia are encountered on the outer surface of the developing embryo as well as in the developing and developed digestive tract of embryos and larvae.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_46514>)
