# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000410> (ventral transverse rod)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000410> "A skeletal rod that forms initially from one of the three radii of the embryonic triradiate spicule rudiment and extends toward the ventral midline along the oral side of the embryo. It ceases growth early in development without ever branching.")
