AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000458> "The very distal, thick tip of a body rod, or in some species the basket-like skeletal rod that forms from the branching of the distal tip of a body rod and extends laterally. The scheitel supports the tip of the apex.")
