# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000497> (blastopore)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000497> "The orifice of invagination of the endomesodermal cells during the embryonic stages of an organism. The opening of the archenteron to the exterior, which will later develop into the larval anus.")
