AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000527> "A mesodermally lined cavity that in adult is positioned inside the body to surround and contain the digestive tract and other organs, while in embryos and larvae it forms from the tip of the archenteron and lie between the gut and the outer body wall.")
