AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000602> "A heterogeneous subclass of blastocoelar cells; 5–7 μm in diameter, and with 2 to 5 filopodial projections that extend 10–50 μm. Filopodial cells are located in the blastocoel and across the basal surface of ectoderm and gut epithelia, and form multiple interconnected, syncytial networks.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002175> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000602> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_7654>)
