AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ECAO_2000604> "A subclass of blastoceolar cells; 10–15 μm on their longest axis,  granular, oval-shaped, and non-syncytial. Ovoid cells arise in the blastocoel under some conditions of immune challenge, possibly from a morphological transformation of filopodial cells.")
